    apply: "Make a chart of the four lists and note which gifts appear in more than one. Highlight three you might have and three you might see in others. Ask a friend which they see in you. Memorise Romans 12:6. Write down what you learn and share it with your group next week.",
    activity: "Divide into four groups to study each list and report. Compile a combined list on the board. Group the gifts under speaking and serving. Discuss the differing views with respect. Pray.",
